create a new hw_attn_params structure as below:
```
struct hw_attn_params {
  size_t kv_head_size;
  size_t n_kv_heads;
  size_t n_heads;
  size_t gqa;  // grouped query attention: number of query heads per key/value head

  std::string debug_string() const {
    return fmt::format(
        "hw_attn_params {{ kv_head_size: {} n_kv_heads: {} n_heads: {} gqa: {} }}",
        kv_head_size, n_kv_heads, n_heads, gqa);
  }
};
```

modify the wqentry struct to remove those variables, and instead hold a pointer to a hw_attn_params structure provided by the model
